#: ckanext/harvestplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:4
msgid "¿What are the Seals of Excellence?"
msgstr "¿Cuáles son los sellos de Excelencia?"

#: ckanext/harvestplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:8
msgid ""
"The Digital Government Excellence Seals are a recognition from the "
"Ministry of Information Technologies and Communications (MinTIC) for "
"digital services and open datasets that meet high standards of quality, "
"security, accessibility, and transparency. It certifies that the State's "
"digital products respond to citizens' needs, comply with regulations, "
"promote trust and participation, and guarantee continuous improvement. "
"For open data, it ensures that it is useful, up-to-date, and reusable."
msgstr ""
"The Digital Government Excellence Seals are a recognition from the "
"Ministry of Information Technologies and Communications (MinTIC) for "
"digital services and open datasets that meet high standards of quality, "
"security, accessibility, and transparency. It certifies that the State's "
"digital products respond to citizens' needs, comply with regulations, "
"promote trust and participation, and guarantee continuous improvement. "
"For open data, it ensures that it is useful, up-to-date, and reusable."
msgstr ""
"Los Sellos de Excelencia del Gobierno Digital son un reconocimiento del "
"\"\"Ministerio de Tecnologías de la Información y las Comunicaciones "
"(MinTIC)\n"
" a los servicios digitales y conjuntos de datos abiertos que cumplen con "
"altos\n"
"estándares de calidad, seguridad, accesibilidad y transparencia. "
"\"\"\"Certifica que\n"
"los productos digitales del Estado responden a las necesidades de los "
"ciudadanos,\n"
"cumplen con las regulaciones, promueven la confianza y la participación, "
"y \"\"\"garantizan\n"
"la mejora continua. En el caso de los datos abiertos, asegura que sean "
"\"\"\"útiles, actualizados\n"
"y reutilizables.\n"

